{
  "mark.1.p1.b1": {
    "text": "神的儿子，耶稣基督福音的起头。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "神的儿⁠子，耶⁠稣基⁠督福⁠音的起头。"
  },
  "mark.1.p1.b2": {
    "text": "……看哪，我要差遣我的使者在你前面，预备道路。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "……看哪，我⁠要差⁠遣我⁠的使⁠者在你前⁠面，预⁠备道⁠路。"
  },
  "mark.1.p1.b3": {
    "text": "在旷野有人声喊着说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "在旷⁠野有⁠人声喊着说："
  },
  "mark.1.p1.b4": {
    "text": "预备主的道，修直他的路。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "预⁠备主的道，修直他⁠的路。"
  },
  "mark.1.p2.b1": {
    "text": "照这话，约翰来了，在旷野施洗，传悔改的洗礼，使罪得赦。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "照这话，约⁠翰来了，在旷⁠野施⁠洗，传悔⁠改的洗⁠礼，使罪得赦。"
  },
  "mark.1.p2.b2": {
    "text": "犹太全地和耶路撒冷的人都出去到约翰那里，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "犹⁠太全地和耶⁠路撒⁠冷的人都出⁠去到约⁠翰那⁠里，"
  },
  "mark.1.p2.b3": {
    "text": "承认他们的罪，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "承⁠认他⁠们的罪，"
  },
  "mark.1.p3.b1": {
    "text": "有一位在我以后来的，能力比我更大，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "有一⁠位在我以⁠后来的，能⁠力比我更⁠大，"
  },
  "mark.1.p3.b2": {
    "text": "我就是弯腰给他解鞋带也是不配的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我就⁠是弯⁠腰给他解鞋⁠带也⁠是不⁠配的。"
  },
  "mark.1.p3.b3": {
    "text": "我是用水给你们施洗，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我⁠是用⁠水给你⁠们施⁠洗，"
  },
  "mark.1.p3.b4": {
    "text": "他却要用圣灵给你们施洗。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他却⁠要用圣⁠灵给你⁠们施⁠洗。"
  },
  "mark.1.p4.b1": {
    "text": "那时，耶稣从加利利的拿撒勒来，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那⁠时，耶⁠稣从加⁠利⁠利的拿⁠撒⁠勒来，"
  },
  "mark.1.p4.b2": {
    "text": "在约旦河里受了约翰的洗。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "在约⁠旦⁠河里受了约⁠翰的洗。"
  },
  "mark.1.p4.b3": {
    "text": "他从水里一上来，就看见天裂开了，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他从水⁠里一上⁠来，就看⁠见天裂开了，"
  },
  "mark.1.p5.b1": {
    "text": "圣灵仿佛鸽子，降在他身上。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "圣⁠灵仿⁠佛鸽⁠子，降在他身⁠上。"
  },
  "mark.1.p5.b2": {
    "text": "又有声音从天上来，说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "又⁠有声⁠音从天上⁠来，说："
  },
  "mark.1.p5.b3": {
    "text": "你是我的爱子，我喜悦你。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠是我⁠的爱子，我喜⁠悦你。"
  },
  "mark.1.p6.b1": {
    "text": "圣灵就把耶稣催到旷野里去。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "圣⁠灵就⁠把耶⁠稣催到旷⁠野里去。"
  },
  "mark.1.p6.b2": {
    "text": "他在旷野四十天，受撒但的试探，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠在旷⁠野四⁠十天，受撒⁠但的试⁠探，"
  },
  "mark.1.p6.b3": {
    "text": "并与野兽同在一处，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "并⁠与野⁠兽同在一处，"
  },
  "mark.1.p6.b4": {
    "text": "且有天使来伺候他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "且有天⁠使来伺⁠候他。"
  },
  "mark.1.p7.b1": {
    "text": "约翰下监以后，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "约⁠翰下监以⁠后，"
  },
  "mark.1.p7.b2": {
    "text": "耶稣来到加利利，宣传神的福音，说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:14-15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣来⁠到加⁠利⁠利，宣⁠传神的福⁠音，说："
  },
  "mark.1.p7.b3": {
    "text": "日期满了，神的国近了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "日⁠期满⁠了，神⁠的国近了。"
  },
  "mark.1.p7.b4": {
    "text": "你们当悔改，信福音！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们当悔⁠改，信福⁠音！"
  },
  "mark.1.p8.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣顺着加利利的海边走，看见西门和西门的兄弟安得烈在海里撒网；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣顺⁠着加⁠利⁠利的海⁠边走，看⁠见西⁠门和西⁠门的兄⁠弟安⁠得⁠烈在海⁠里撒网；"
  },
  "mark.1.p8.b2": {
    "text": "来跟从我，我要叫你们得人如得鱼一样。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "来跟从我，我⁠要叫你⁠们得人如得鱼一⁠样。"
  },
  "mark.1.p8.b3": {
    "text": "他们就立刻舍了网，跟从了他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们就立⁠刻舍了网，跟从了他。"
  },
  "mark.1.p9.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣稍往前走，又见西庇太的儿子雅各和雅各的兄弟约翰在船上补网。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣稍往⁠前⁠走，又见西⁠庇⁠太的儿⁠子雅⁠各和雅⁠各的兄⁠弟约⁠翰在船⁠上补网。"
  },
  "mark.1.p9.b2": {
    "text": "耶稣随即招呼他们，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣随⁠即招⁠呼他⁠们，"
  },
  "mark.1.p9.b3": {
    "text": "他们就把父亲西庇太和雇工人留在船上，跟从耶稣去了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们就⁠把父⁠亲西⁠庇⁠太和雇⁠工人留⁠在船⁠上，跟从耶⁠稣去⁠了。"
  },
  "mark.1.p10.b1": {
    "text": "到了迦百农，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "到⁠了迦⁠百⁠农，"
  },
  "mark.1.p10.b2": {
    "text": "耶稣就在安息日进了会堂教训人。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣就⁠在安⁠息⁠日进了会⁠堂教⁠训人。"
  },
  "mark.1.p10.b3": {
    "text": "众人很希奇他的教训；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "众⁠人很希⁠奇他⁠的教⁠训；"
  },
  "mark.1.p10.b4": {
    "text": "因为他教训他们，正像有权柄的人，不像文士。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "因⁠为他教⁠训他⁠们，正⁠像有⁠权柄的人，不⁠像文⁠士。"
  },
  "mark.1.p11.b1": {
    "text": "在会堂里，有一个人被污鬼附着。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "在会⁠堂里，有⁠一个⁠人被污⁠鬼附⁠着。"
  },
  "mark.1.p11.b2": {
    "text": "他喊叫说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他喊⁠叫说："
  },
  "mark.1.p11.b3": {
    "text": "拿撒勒人耶稣，我们与你有什么相干？你来灭我们吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "拿⁠撒⁠勒人耶⁠稣，我⁠们与你⁠有什⁠么相⁠干？你⁠来灭我⁠们吗？"
  },
  "mark.1.p11.b4": {
    "text": "我知道你是谁，乃是神的圣者。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我⁠知⁠道你⁠是谁，乃⁠是神的圣⁠者。"
  },
  "mark.1.p11.b5": {
    "text": "耶稣责备他说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣责⁠备他说："
  },
  "mark.1.p11.b6": {
    "text": "不要作声！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "不⁠要作声！"
  },
  "mark.1.p11.b7": {
    "text": "从这人身上出来吧。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "从这人身⁠上出⁠来吧。"
  },
  "mark.1.p12.b1": {
    "text": "污鬼叫那人抽了一阵风，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "污⁠鬼叫那人抽了⁠一阵⁠风，"
  },
  "mark.1.p12.b2": {
    "text": "大声喊叫，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "大⁠声喊⁠叫，"
  },
  "mark.1.p12.b3": {
    "text": "就出来了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就出⁠来了。"
  },
  "mark.1.p12.b4": {
    "text": "众人都惊讶，以致彼此对问说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "众⁠人都惊⁠讶，以⁠致彼⁠此对问说："
  },
  "mark.1.p12.b5": {
    "text": "这是什么事？是个新道理啊！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这是什⁠么事？是个新道⁠理啊！"
  },
  "mark.1.p12.b6": {
    "text": "他用权柄吩咐污鬼，连污鬼也听从了他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠用权⁠柄吩⁠咐污⁠鬼，连污⁠鬼也听⁠从了他。"
  },
  "mark.1.p12.b7": {
    "text": "耶稣的名声就传遍了加利利的四方。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣的名⁠声就传⁠遍了加⁠利⁠利的四⁠方。"
  },
  "mark.1.p13.b1": {
    "text": "他们一出会堂，……进了西门和安得烈的家。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠们一出会⁠堂，……进了西⁠门和安⁠得⁠烈的家。"
  },
  "mark.1.p13.b2": {
    "text": "西门的岳母正害热病躺着，就有人告诉耶稣。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "西⁠门的岳⁠母正害热⁠病躺着，就⁠有人告⁠诉耶⁠稣。"
  },
  "mark.1.p13.b3": {
    "text": "耶稣进前拉着她的手，扶她起来，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣进前拉着她⁠的手，扶她起⁠来，"
  },
  "mark.1.p13.b4": {
    "text": "热就退了，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.1.p14.b1": {
    "text": "天晚日落的时候，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "天晚日落的时⁠候，"
  },
  "mark.1.p14.b2": {
    "text": "合城的人都聚集在门前。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "合城的人都聚⁠集在门⁠前。"
  },
  "mark.1.p14.b3": {
    "text": "耶稣治好了许多害各样病的人，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣治⁠好了许⁠多害各⁠样病⁠的人，"
  },
  "mark.1.p14.b4": {
    "text": "又赶出许多鬼，不许鬼说话，因为鬼认识他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "又赶⁠出许⁠多鬼，不⁠许鬼说⁠话，因⁠为鬼认⁠识他。"
  },
  "mark.1.p15.b1": {
    "text": "次日早晨，天未亮的时候，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "次日早⁠晨，天未亮的时⁠候，"
  },
  "mark.1.p15.b2": {
    "text": "众人都找你。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "众⁠人都找你。"
  },
  "mark.1.p15.b3": {
    "text": "我们可以往别处去，……我也好在那里传道，因为我是为这事出来的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我⁠们可⁠以往别⁠处去，……我⁠也好在那⁠里传⁠道，因⁠为我⁠是为这事出⁠来的。"
  },
  "mark.1.p15.b4": {
    "text": "于是在加利利全地，进了会堂，传道，赶鬼。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:39"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "于⁠是在加⁠利⁠利全地，进了会⁠堂，传⁠道，赶鬼。"
  },
  "mark.1.p16.b1": {
    "text": "有一个长大麻风的来求耶稣，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "有一⁠个长大⁠麻⁠风的来求耶⁠稣，"
  },
  "mark.1.p17.b1": {
    "text": "向他跪下，说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "向他跪⁠下，说："
  },
  "mark.1.p17.b2": {
    "text": "你若肯，必能叫我洁净了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你若肯，必能叫我洁⁠净了。"
  },
  "mark.1.p17.b3": {
    "text": "耶稣动了慈心，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣动⁠了慈⁠心，"
  },
  "mark.1.p18.b1": {
    "text": "就伸手摸他，说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就伸⁠手摸他，说："
  },
  "mark.1.p18.b2": {
    "text": "我肯，你洁净了吧！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我肯，你洁⁠净了吧！"
  },
  "mark.1.p19.b1": {
    "text": "大麻风即时离开他，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "大⁠麻⁠风即⁠时离⁠开他，"
  },
  "mark.1.p19.b2": {
    "text": "他就洁净了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他就洁⁠净了。"
  },
  "mark.1.p20.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣严严地嘱咐他，就打发他走，对他说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:43-44"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣严⁠严地嘱⁠咐他，就打⁠发他走，对他说："
  },
  "mark.1.p20.b2": {
    "text": "你要谨慎，什么话都不可告诉人，只要去把身体给祭司察看，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:44"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠要谨⁠慎，什⁠么话都不⁠可告⁠诉人，只⁠要去把身⁠体给祭⁠司察⁠看，"
  },
  "mark.1.p20.b3": {
    "text": "又因为你洁净了，献上摩西所吩咐的礼物，对众人作证据。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:44"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "又因⁠为你洁⁠净了，献⁠上摩⁠西所吩⁠咐的礼⁠物，对众⁠人作证⁠据。"
  },
  "mark.1.p20.b4": {
    "text": "那人出去，倒说许多的话，把这件事传扬开了，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:45"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那人出⁠去，倒说许⁠多的⁠话，把这件事传⁠扬开了，"
  },
  "mark.1.p20.b5": {
    "text": "叫耶稣以后不得再明明地进城，只好在外边旷野地方。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:45"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "叫耶⁠稣以⁠后不⁠得再明⁠明地进城，只⁠好在外⁠边旷⁠野地⁠方。"
  },
  "mark.1.p20.b6": {
    "text": "人从各处都就了他来。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "Mark 1:45"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "人从各⁠处都就了他来。"
  }
}
